output:
The face of Jesus Christ has appeared on a pine dining table in California, shocking the couple who own it. The couple, Jaimie Beebe and Gary Ousdahl, have put the table on eBay with a $5,000 price tag but have yet to receive any bids. This is not the first time images of Christ have appeared on unexpected objects, with instances including toast, pancakes, crisps, banana peel, pizza, and ice cream.

//" It just appeared that night, it was like a miracle" said Jamie Beebe, a 37 year old casting director from Los Angeles.  Beebe and her boyfriend, Gary Ousdahl, 37, have put the table up for sale on eBay with a $5,000 price tag, but so far, have not received any bids.  This is not the first time that images of Jesus Christ have appeared on unexpected objects.  In October, a Manchester man inserted a slice of wholemeal bread into his toaster and was shocked when it popped out with the face of Jesus Christ.  

